---
title: "Phase 1 architecture, part 2 of 2 — features and provenance"
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class TerrainSource {
        <<abstract, Strategy>>
        +load(study_area) TerrainLayer
    }
    class FixtureTerrainSource
    class GEBCOTerrainSource {
        <<Checkpoint 1>>
    }
    note for TerrainSource "STRATEGY - synthetic today, real GEBCO at Checkpoint 1, swapped without touching a recipe"

    TerrainSource <|-- FixtureTerrainSource
    TerrainSource <|.. GEBCOTerrainSource

    class TerrainLayer {
        +path
        +content_hash
    }
    class DemGrid {
        +values
        +dx_m_per_row
        +dy_m
        +from_terrain_layer(layer)
        +load(path)
    }
    note for DemGrid "the ONE home of the CRS decision - degrees to metres, scaled per row of latitude"

    TerrainSource --> TerrainLayer : produces
    TerrainLayer --> DemGrid : bridged by from_terrain_layer

    class CovariateRecipe {
        <<abstract, Strategy + Template Method>>
        +RECIPE_VERSION
        +build(grid) CovariateResult
        -_resolve_windows()
        -_compute()
    }
    note for CovariateRecipe "TEMPLATE METHOD - resolve windows, compute, attach provenance. No recipe can skip the provenance step"

    class DepthRecipe
    class HornSlopeRecipe
    class BpiRecipe
    note for BpiRecipe "8 recipes in total - depth, slope, aspect, roughness, profile and plan curvature, TPI, BPI"

    CovariateRecipe <|-- DepthRecipe
    CovariateRecipe <|-- HornSlopeRecipe
    CovariateRecipe <|-- BpiRecipe

    class CovariateRegistry {
        <<Registry>>
        +build(name, grid)
        +build_all(grid)
    }
    note for CovariateRegistry "REGISTRY - refuses to build if the contract's recipe_version disagrees with the code"

    CovariateRegistry o-- CovariateRecipe
    CovariateRegistry --> DemGrid : reads

    class PipelineObserver {
        <<abstract, Observer>>
        +on_fetched()
        +on_adapted()
        +on_resolved()
        +on_admitted()
    }
    class NullObserver {
        <<Null Object, default>>
    }
    class ProvenanceRecorder {
        +sources()
    }
    note for PipelineObserver "OBSERVER - the pipeline reports without owning reporting. Recording never changes a decision"
    note for NullObserver "NULL OBJECT - the default, so an unobserved pipeline needs no conditionals"

    PipelineObserver <|-- NullObserver
    PipelineObserver <|-- ProvenanceRecorder

    class ProvenanceArtifact {
        <<Layer Supertype>>
        +generated_at
        +content_hash
        +contract_versions
        +upstream_hashes
        +finalize()
    }
    class CorpusManifest {
        +training_eligible_count
        +contributing_sources
    }
    class FeatureStackManifest {
        +layers
        +registry_version
    }
    class RunManifest {
        <<Phase 2>>
        +seed
        +cv_scores
    }
    note for ProvenanceArtifact "LAYER SUPERTYPE - one set of chaining fields, identically named, so a prediction traces back to exactly one corpus"

    ProvenanceArtifact <|-- CorpusManifest
    ProvenanceArtifact <|-- FeatureStackManifest
    ProvenanceArtifact <|-- RunManifest

    ProvenanceRecorder --> CorpusManifest : feeds
    CovariateRegistry --> FeatureStackManifest : feeds
    CorpusManifest --> RunManifest : upstream hash
    FeatureStackManifest --> RunManifest : upstream hash

